    {
      "text": "Fig 9, 'Inconsistent use of standardized product nomenclature across the supply chain'. A dashed arrow marks the physical flow of health products from manufacturers through the central warehouse, health facilities and community health workers to patients. Below, each holds the same product under a different code: product code 123123 at the manufacturer, A1232 in mSupply, P44545 in eLMIS and AM545 on paper forms, joined by broken chain-link icons.",
